# ── Local inputs (see data/README.md) ──────────────────────────────────────
# The NWI rasters stay out of git — GSL alone is ~114 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB
# per-file limit. The calibration tables are ~1 KB each and ARE tracked: they
# are the authoritative record of the thresholds this project ships.
data/*
!data/README.md
!data/threshold_cv_summary.csv
!data/ndmi_threshold_cv_all.csv

# ── Generated outputs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
outputs/
water_extent_monthly_*.csv
water_extent_timeseries_*.png
stage_area_*.png
*.tif

# ── Python ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── OS / editor ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
